    'qs.pub.desc': 'Build a Protobuf message, then <code>pub.publish()</code> it onto <code>dds://sensor/imu</code>. Business code only touches the data; the URL decides the transport.',
    'qs.sub.title':'Subscriber · message arrives inside the callback',
